{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3109","id":3329163040,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887Gbv8g","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3109","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3109.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3109.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3109","number":3109,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"types: avoid NodeView clone in CanAccess","user":{"login":"dmeremyanin","id":241633,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MTYzMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241633?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmeremyanin","html_url":"https://github.com/dmeremyanin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmeremyanin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmeremyanin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmeremyanin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmeremyanin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmeremyanin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmeremyanin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmeremyanin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmeremyanin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmeremyanin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"NodeView.CanAccess called node2.AsStruct() on every check. In peer-map construction we run CanAccess in O(n^2) pair scans (often twice per pair), so that per-call clone multiplied into large heap churn.\r\n\r\nThis PR removes that clone path in `CanAccess` and keeps the same behavior.\r\n\r\nI also added a simple benchmark. Local results:\r\n```\r\n❯ go test ./hscontrol/types -run '^$' -bench BenchmarkNodeViewCanAccess -benchmem\r\ngoos: darwin\r\ngoarch: arm64\r\npkg: github.com/juanfont/headscale/hscontrol/types\r\ncpu: Apple M4 Pro\r\nBenchmarkNodeViewCanAccess/pointer-14           26586536                45.93 ns/op           48 B/op          2 allocs/op\r\nBenchmarkNodeViewCanAccess/struct_clone-14        513435              2254 ns/op           14944 B/op         10 allocs/op\r\nPASS\r\nok      github.com/juanfont/headscale/hscontrol/types   2.590s\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo it's roughly 50x faster in this benchmark, with much lower allocations.\r\n\r\nFixes #3108\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n- [x] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [ ] added unit tests\r\n- [x] added integration tests\r\n- [ ] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [ ] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n","created_at":"2026-02-26T05:47:16Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T14:45:53Z","closed_at":"2026-02-27T03:15:07Z","merged_at":"2026-02-27T03:15:07Z","merge_commit_sha":"610c1daa4dfd1ccff642e066d0740231a25e3079","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.gith